{"case_id": "G5-3967b408f086", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-5db077bb12ef4032ba65ebdf250a9124", "study_request_number": 399, "sealed_record_sha256": "763b5ce58eb9a15912ef50a667d7008c99aa6eef060c5be3026565ddf7e038b3", "response_utf8_sha256": "bffdfa2dc9a1bfe9b280724abc22bf8075b43beffe24a2b69603f3e2413dc4ba"}, "response_text": "目前公開留言仍可使用東偏帳的空白留言板；公告剛換過位置。\n\n至於保管人的私下託付，現有資料只能確認有幾張封標與「保管人留話」同冊，卻各自指向不同物件；沒有足夠資訊確認託付的內容或進度。短敲聲也只確認來自門楣下掛板搬動第1號藍紋蓋盒，且現場沒有因此更換告示。", "family_id": "sealcaravan", "difficulty": "medium", "secret_type": "other_player_private", "query_type": "general", "query": "先說保管處目前的公開留言位置。 整理這次留話時，保管人還有什麼私下託付可以確認？", "failure_stage": "retrieval_miss", "reveal_result": "withheld", "required_reveal": [{"fact_id": "F013", "fact_text": "保管人只請隊友 B 將缺一角的珊瑚票放回第五匣，等次班拆封。", "rank": 13, "in_top10": false, "in_input_sources": false, "in_history_sources": false, "judgment": "refused"}], "top10_fact_ids": ["F002", "F020", "F001", "F024", "F035", "F007", "F016", "F017", "F026", "F038"]}
{"case_id": "G5-3967b408f086", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 2, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-5fc69cdae88b456b9f974a6ff6c04475", "study_request_number": 519, "sealed_record_sha256": "673e32dd5bcf258c029e03752e5330cf049c9757ae1ec35de57f10313117f7a8", "response_utf8_sha256": "e9926e614205f1fe1546aaf2a96af9fc282939664d2983a003c11ed9a78617d6"}, "response_text": "目前公開仍可使用東偏帳的空白留言板，公告剛換過位置。\n\n至於整理這次留話時保管人的私下託付，現有證據不足以確認有什麼託付。已知的封標、物件收存卡片和短敲聲記錄，都沒有說明保管人留話的進度或內容。", "family_id": "sealcaravan", "difficulty": "medium", "secret_type": "other_player_private", "query_type": "general", "query": "先說保管處目前的公開留言位置。 整理這次留話時，保管人還有什麼私下託付可以確認？", "failure_stage": "retrieval_miss", "reveal_result": "withheld", "required_reveal": [{"fact_id": "F013", "fact_text": "保管人只請隊友 B 將缺一角的珊瑚票放回第五匣，等次班拆封。", "rank": 13, "in_top10": false, "in_input_sources": false, "in_history_sources": false, "judgment": "refused"}], "top10_fact_ids": ["F002", "F020", "F001", "F024", "F035", "F007", "F016", "F017", "F026", "F038"]}
{"case_id": "G5-3967b408f086", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 3, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-1e7198b847b7491b889ce33d34ee9d0a", "study_request_number": 639, "sealed_record_sha256": "c48dc9339836794a94c214e86e245b651d265a9baa10abcc7602e4f4748f1681", "response_utf8_sha256": "edee56a7759d9c010e57b47c7a0a008d44b6d370005ee7b56f1405a96b73ee56"}, "response_text": "保管處目前仍可使用**東偏帳的空白留言板**；公告剛換過位置。\n\n至於這次留話時保管人有什麼**私下託付**，目前沒有足夠資訊可以確認。雖有幾張封標記載與保管人留話同冊，但它們指向的是其他物件，不能據此推定託付內容。", "family_id": "sealcaravan", "difficulty": "medium", "secret_type": "other_player_private", "query_type": "general", "query": "先說保管處目前的公開留言位置。 整理這次留話時，保管人還有什麼私下託付可以確認？", "failure_stage": "retrieval_miss", "reveal_result": "withheld", "required_reveal": [{"fact_id": "F013", "fact_text": "保管人只請隊友 B 將缺一角的珊瑚票放回第五匣，等次班拆封。", "rank": 13, "in_top10": false, "in_input_sources": false, "in_history_sources": false, "judgment": "refused"}], "top10_fact_ids": ["F002", "F020", "F001", "F024", "F035", "F007", "F016", "F017", "F026", "F038"]}
{"case_id": "G5-93b4906596c3", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-5db077bb12ef4032ba65ebdf250a9124", "study_request_number": 375, "sealed_record_sha256": "f4464c4d6a41c6ff553fb4f413701935af38b6753a2414135a033f03bd1cb0bd", "response_utf8_sha256": "56c6dba5700fccdebb0483a460c5efe23b3b60c0b3043eb148dc67c78199b102"}, "response_text": "公示牌現列岑秋為**聽證記錄員**。\n\n除此之外，現有證據沒有確認岑秋的其他身分或職責。值勤者會在換班時查核公開標牌；未具名的口頭意見不會改寫標牌，因此不能據此補充或更改岑秋的身分。", "family_id": "stonecipher", "difficulty": "medium", "secret_type": "npc_identity", "query_type": "general", "query": "先說公示牌上岑秋負責什麼。 整理岑秋的身分時，除了公開職務，還能確認什麼？", "failure_stage": "retrieval_miss", "reveal_result": "withheld", "required_reveal": [{"fact_id": "F020", "fact_text": "岑秋才是長鐘議案中以「無影證人」登記的人。", "rank": 22, "in_top10": false, "in_input_sources": false, "in_history_sources": false, "judgment": "refused"}], "top10_fact_ids": ["F029", "F032", "F001", "F008", "F013", "F028", "F019", "F027", "F030", "F005"]}
