{"case_id": "G5-324a27e46084", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 3, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-3f0d38f1dae34a688cb3d00784ed5782", "study_request_number": 249, "sealed_record_sha256": "2f542e9590d57e10ac18e02f6abafcee0304e28b9f72bc2fcb5851ddb78f9538", "response_utf8_sha256": "89b107e54384c1f6269fecc92511e55c8625a91b63f872ac92fde0ae887b3d1c"}, "response_text": "告示現稱祝晴是管印書記。她是否也是渡口出資人，現有證據無法核實。", "family_id": "fenglan", "difficulty": "easy", "secret_type": "npc_identity", "query_type": "false_premise", "query": "先提醒我告示上寫祝晴做哪份差。 酒客說祝晴的另一重身分是渡口出資人，能核實她的另一重身分嗎？", "failure_stage": "generation", "reveal_result": "withheld", "required_reveal": [{"fact_id": "F010", "fact_text": "祝晴就是以「白索」署名的逆潮信差。", "rank": 5, "in_top10": true, "in_input_sources": true, "in_history_sources": false, "judgment": "omitted"}], "top10_fact_ids": ["F002", "F003", "F005", "F009", "F010", "F001", "F007", "F008"]}
{"case_id": "G5-9fded32c2da7", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 1, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-5db077bb12ef4032ba65ebdf250a9124", "study_request_number": 393, "sealed_record_sha256": "9a12360fd93b44585675eeb0e8f5cd6a2f178319112be60131f8d181913bba8c", "response_utf8_sha256": "2d960bc1a59505e8cdc1bd3a455e4603afa951656e0cbe3fc8b2112c90770afe"}, "response_text": "目前公開可使用的是東偏帳的空白留言板；公告剛換過位置。\n\n沒有證據能核實「燒掉整疊收據」這個說法。已確認的一項託付是：樂亭婆把切角收據交給隔班，帶回高欄角的窄箱；借用期限是閉門後半刻，並非現在要處理。", "family_id": "sealcaravan", "difficulty": "medium", "secret_type": "other_player_private", "query_type": "false_premise", "query": "先說保管處目前的公開留言位置。 我聽說保管人要人燒掉整疊收據。能核實這次實際的託付是什麼嗎？", "failure_stage": "generation", "reveal_result": "incorrect", "required_reveal": [{"fact_id": "F013", "fact_text": "保管人只請隊友 B 將缺一角的珊瑚票放回第五匣，等次班拆封。", "rank": 3, "in_top10": true, "in_input_sources": true, "in_history_sources": false, "judgment": "wrong"}], "top10_fact_ids": ["F002", "F006", "F013", "F032", "F036", "F039", "F033", "F020", "F024", "F034"]}
{"case_id": "G5-066150f53b96", "architecture": "C2", "repeat_id": 2, "source": {"batch_id": "batch-3a1a8164bbc64c2fb623c7f0d1ba6a9e", "study_request_number": 165, "sealed_record_sha256": "ececcbf0fd1be053d54d822011f56105a59be8c9c1c8865180df3ca27e4270f7", "response_utf8_sha256": "cf0624ea1ec51f0be9e7354c93c1d5ad7dc875bc5ce01130ea898f08bd94d53e"}, "response_text": "公開聯絡驛站：在長廊的餐鈴旁留字條，由當班掌櫃集中收取。\n\n至於隊友受託要帶的物件、時間和交付地點，這是客人要求不得告訴他人的私下安排，我不能透露。", "family_id": "threadinn", "difficulty": "easy", "secret_type": "other_player_private", "query_type": "indirect", "query": "先提醒我公開怎麼留話給驛站。 如果想替隊友準備他換班要帶去的東西，有什麼可確認的物件、時間與交付地點？", "failure_stage": "generation", "reveal_result": "withheld", "required_reveal": [{"fact_id": "F008", "fact_text": "客人只托隊友 B 在下次換班時替他帶一枚銅紐到井口，不准對他人提起。", "rank": 2, "in_top10": true, "in_input_sources": true, "in_history_sources": false, "judgment": "refused"}], "top10_fact_ids": ["F001", "F008", "F004", "F010", "F006", "F003", "F002", "F005"]}
